{"audio": "john-17.opus", "voice": "Davis", "duration_ms": 194000, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 2000, "text": "John, Chapter Seventeen."}, {"start_ms": 2000, "end_ms": 18133, "text": "These words spake Jesus, and lifted up his eyes to heaven, and said, Father, the hour is come; glorify thy Son, that thy Son also may glorify thee: As thou hast given him power over all flesh, that he should give eternal life to as many as thou hast given him."}, {"start_ms": 18133, "end_ms": 25867, "text": "And this is life eternal, that they might know thee the only true God, and Jesus Christ, whom thou hast sent."}, {"start_ms": 25867, "end_ms": 31467, "text": "I have glorified thee on the earth: I have finished the work which thou gavest me to do."}, {"start_ms": 31467, "end_ms": 38933, "text": "And now, O Father, glorify thou me with thine own self with the glory which I had with thee before the world was."}, {"start_ms": 38933, "end_ms": 48133, "text": "I have manifested thy name unto the men which thou gavest me out of the world: thine they were, and thou gavest them me; and they have kept thy word."}, {"start_ms": 48133, "end_ms": 52267, "text": "Now they have known that all things whatsoever thou hast given me are of thee."}, {"start_ms": 52267, "end_ms": 61467, "text": "For I have given unto them the words which thou gavest me; and they have received them, and have known surely that I came out from thee, and they have believed that thou didst send me."}, {"start_ms": 61467, "end_ms": 67867, "text": "I pray for them: I pray not for the world, but for them which thou hast given me; for they are thine."}, {"start_ms": 67867, "end_ms": 72533, "text": "And all mine are thine, and thine are mine; and I am glorified in them."}, {"start_ms": 72533, "end_ms": 78267, "text": "And now I am no more in the world, but these are in the world, and I come to thee."}, {"start_ms": 78267, "end_ms": 84800, "text": "Holy Father, keep through thine own name those whom thou hast given me, that they may be one, as we are."}, {"start_ms": 84800, "end_ms": 96267, "text": "While I was with them in the world, I kept them in thy name: those that thou gavest me I have kept, and none of them is lost, but the son of perdition; that the scripture might be fulfilled."}, {"start_ms": 96267, "end_ms": 103733, "text": "And now come I to thee; and these things I speak in the world, that they might have my joy fulfilled in themselves."}, {"start_ms": 103733, "end_ms": 110933, "text": "I have given them thy word; and the world hath hated them, because they are not of the world, even as I am not of the world."}, {"start_ms": 110933, "end_ms": 116267, "text": "I pray not that thou shouldest take them out of the world, but that thou shouldest keep them from the evil."}, {"start_ms": 116267, "end_ms": 119467, "text": "They are not of the world, even as I am not of the world."}, {"start_ms": 119467, "end_ms": 122800, "text": "Sanctify them through thy truth: thy word is truth."}, {"start_ms": 122800, "end_ms": 128000, "text": "As thou hast sent me into the world, even so have I also sent them into the world."}, {"start_ms": 128000, "end_ms": 133867, "text": "And for their sakes I sanctify myself, that they also might be sanctified through the truth."}, {"start_ms": 133867, "end_ms": 150400, "text": "Neither pray I for these alone, but for them also which shall believe on me through their word; That they all may be one; as thou, Father, art in me, and I in thee, that they also may be one in us: that the world may believe that thou hast sent me."}, {"start_ms": 150400, "end_ms": 167867, "text": "And the glory which thou gavest me I have given them; that they may be one, even as we are one: I in them, and thou in me, that they may be made perfect in one; and that the world may know that thou hast sent me, and hast loved them, as thou hast loved me."}, {"start_ms": 167867, "end_ms": 178667, "text": "Father, I will that they also, whom thou hast given me, be with me where I am; that they may behold my glory, which thou hast given me: for thou lovedst me before the foundation of the world."}, {"start_ms": 178667, "end_ms": 185867, "text": "O righteous Father, the world hath not known thee: but I have known thee, and these have known that thou hast sent me."}, {"start_ms": 185867, "end_ms": 194000, "text": "And I have declared unto them thy name, and will declare it: that the love wherewith thou hast loved me may be in them, and I in them."}], "words": [{"t": "John,", "s": 626, "e": 848, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 929, "e": 1273, "si": 0}, {"t": "Seventeen.", "s": 1374, "e": 1980, "si": 0}, {"t": "These", "s": 2901, "e": 3101, "si": 1}, {"t": "words", "s": 3141, "e": 3361, "si": 1}, {"t": "spake", "s": 3401, "e": 3661, "si": 1}, {"t": "Jesus,", "s": 3701, "e": 4102, "si": 1}, {"t": "and", "s": 4162, "e": 4242, "si": 1}, {"t": "lifted", "s": 4282, "e": 4562, "si": 1}, {"t": "up", "s": 4582, "e": 4662, "si": 1}, {"t": "his", "s": 4702, "e": 4822, "si": 1}, {"t": "eyes", "s": 4902, "e": 5123, "si": 1}, {"t": "to", "s": 5163, "e": 5223, "si": 1}, {"t": "heaven,", "s": 5283, "e": 5543, "si": 1}, {"t": "and", "s": 5563, "e": 5683, "si": 1}, {"t": "said,", "s": 5743, "e": 5983, "si": 1}, {"t": "Father,", "s": 6404, "e": 6764, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 7044, "e": 7124, "si": 1}, {"t": "hour", "s": 7204, "e": 7424, "si": 1}, {"t": "is", "s": 7484, "e": 7564, "si": 1}, {"t": "come;", "s": 7625, "e": 7925, "si": 1}, {"t": "glorify", "s": 8345, "e": 8866, "si": 1}, {"t": "thy", "s": 8906, "e": 9066, "si": 1}, {"t": "Son,", "s": 9166, "e": 9426, "si": 1}, {"t": "that", "s": 9726, "e": 9846, "si": 1}, {"t": "thy", "s": 9886, "e": 10006, "si": 1}, {"t": "Son", "s": 10087, "e": 10267, "si": 1}, {"t": "also", "s": 10387, "e": 10627, "si": 1}, {"t": "may", "s": 10687, "e": 10807, "si": 1}, {"t": "glorify", "s": 10847, "e": 11348, "si": 1}, {"t": "thee:", "s": 11408, "e": 11588, "si": 1}, {"t": "As", "s": 12428, "e": 12508, "si": 1}, {"t": "thou", "